CoorvoOS is based on FreeBSD.  FreeBSD documentation can be installed
with:  pkg install en-freebsd-doc  (see /usr/local/share/doc/freebsd/)
For other languages, replace "en" with a language code like de or fr.

Show the version of CoorvoOS installed:  freebsd-version ; uname -a
Please include that output and any error messages when posting questions.
Introduction to manual pages:  man man
CoorvoOS directory layout:     man hier

To change this login announcement, see motd(5).
